OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader says cliff
OL,4,Asculpture 'not my cup of tea'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Millie Earl said while
OL,7,Fofficers were always seeking such
OL,8,Ffunding, some of the grants available
OL,9,Fwere not for things "we as a council
OL,10,Fhave an ambition to do".
